  <p class="next-level"><span>Next level:</span> one department, one term, inside its LMS.</p>
  <footer class="foot"><span>Self-assessed against NASA ESTO's software readiness levels.</span><span class="slide-number"></span></footer>
  <aside class="notes">5:45 to 6:15. Say the limits slower than the claims.
